{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2016/01/12/8401926/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"成人おめでとうございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2日間の幕張メッセ握手会では"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"同い年の方がたくさん来てくださいました〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな大人っぽくて刺激を受けた ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個別で着た私服撮っていないので、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また改めて(>_<)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2016/01/12/8401926/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"地元では綺麗なブルーの振袖。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2016/01/12/8401926/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"成人式で絶対につけると決めていた"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"YOSHIKOの髪留めヽ(ﾟ､｡)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"小学校からの友達は今でも変わらず"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"連絡取っています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんとに良き仲間に恵まれてる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなそれぞれの道で頑張っていて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"話してて刺激を受けたな"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中3の時の仲間と思い出を話してたんだけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「かたつむり！」って言いながら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ロッカーに入る遊びをしてたらしい笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"意味わからん笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あほなことしかやってなかった！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2016/01/12/8401926/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1000年後のファッションを提案する期間限定店「ようこそ、ISETAN 宇宙支店へ 〜わたしたちの未来の百貨店〜」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新宿ISETANは今日までです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだ行ってないよ！という方はぜひ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"伊勢丹新宿店本館2階＝センターパーク/TOKYO解放区"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2016/01/12/8401926/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"マハロ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}